@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

hide circle
hide methods

class Station {
  country
  timeZone
  timeZoneGroup
  isCity
  isMainStation
  isAirport
}

class RailLine {
  id
  name
}

RailLine "1" --> "1" Station : from >
RailLine "1" --> "1" Station : to   >

note right of RailLine
RailLine direction defines
upgrade dependency:
from before to.
end note

note bottom
Stations and RailLines
form a directed graph.

If cycles exist, no valid
upgrade order exists.
end note

@enduml
